Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.51,0:00:09.76,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.01,0:00:13.42,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,My... mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.83,0:00:17.07,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,No, it can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.16,0:00:20.82,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,My mom is much more...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.82,0:00:22.41,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,I can barely move.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.79,0:00:24.16,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.12,0:00:34.47,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs14\fnTimes New Roman\c&HFFFCF4&\3c&HCDAFA0&\bord0.75\blur1\b1\shad1\4c&H7D605F&\pos(490,20)}Name: None \NSex: Male \NLevel: 1\h/\h∞ \NHP: F\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hFire: F\NMP: F\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hWater: E\NStrength: F\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hWind: F\NStamina: F\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hEarth: F\NIntelligence: F\h\h\h\hLight: F\NSpirit: F\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hDark: F \NSpeed: F \NDexterity: F
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.12,0:00:34.47,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an9\bord2\shad2\blur1\p1\fscy220\alpha&H50&\c&H43312A&\3c&HF8D6AE&\4c&HB7775D&}m 0 0 l 148 0 148 72 0 72
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.76,0:00:28.21,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,Are those... my stats?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.21,0:00:30.44,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,My level's gone back to 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.96,0:00:33.10,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,And... no name?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.48,0:00:35.35,Default,Empress,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.35,0:00:37.96,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,No need. As you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.25,0:00:40.83,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,"Your Majesty"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.83,0:00:42.39,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,What a fine face he has.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.85,0:00:45.55,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,His brow resembles yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.55,0:00:47.53,Default,Empress,0,0,0,,Thank you, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.96,0:00:52.08,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,I believe his mouth looks just like yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.08,0:00:55.23,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,Is this old man an emperor or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.83,0:01:01.54,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,What in the world... is happening... to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.25,0:01:04.99,Default,Cruz,0,0,0,,What shall his name be?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.99,0:01:08.99,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Noah. Noah Ararat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.99,0:01:12.66,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,He shall hold the title of \NThirteenth Imperial Prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.33,0:01:16.09,Default,Empress,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:18.39,0:01:25.81,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(438,0)\an7\fs14\fnTimes New Roman\c&HFFFCF4&\3c&HCDAFA0&\bord0.75\blur1\b1\shad1\4c&H7D605F&\pos(16,20)}Name: Thirteenth Imperial Prince Noah Ararat \NSex: Male \NLevel: 1\h/\h∞
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.39,0:01:25.81,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(438,0)\an7\bord2\shad2\blur1\p1\fscy220\alpha&H50&\c&H867D75&\3c&HF8D6AE&\4c&HB7775D&}m 0 0 l 268 0 268 21 0 21
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.21,0:01:21.67,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,Imperial prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.67,0:01:25.80,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,That's a title given only to the son \Nof an emperor, a noble among nobles!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.80,0:01:27.88,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,What is Noah's affinity?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.88,0:01:29.49,Default,Cruz,0,0,0,,Water, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.05,0:01:34.82,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Then his fief shall be Almeria, a land \Nwhere many of the Water Clan reside.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.82,0:01:41.37,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord1.5\fs30\fnTimes New Roman\b1\blur2\shad6\c&HFEFEFE&\3c&HE4C2B1&\4c&H5E4E4E&\pos(168,102.667)\frx6\fry348\frz2.448}Fire
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.82,0:01:41.37,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord1.5\fs30\fnTimes New Roman\b1\blur2\shad6\c&HFEFEFE&\3c&HE4C2B1&\4c&H5E4E4E&\frx6\fry348\frz2.448\pos(166.667,205.334)}Water
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.82,0:01:41.37,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord1.5\fs30\fnTimes New Roman\b1\blur2\shad6\c&HFEFEFE&\3c&HE4C2B1&\4c&H5E4E4E&\pos(164.667,311.334)\frx2\fry348\frz1.298}Wind
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.14,0:01:35.75,Default,Cruz,0,0,0,,Yes, sire.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.75,0:01:36.65,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,Plus?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.65,0:01:39.09,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,What is this? I've never \Nseen values like these!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.09,0:01:41.37,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,That's one matter settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.74,0:01:45.70,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Cruz, show me his skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.70,0:01:46.54,Default,Cruz,0,0,0,,Yes, sire.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.11,0:01:48.63,Default,Cruz,0,0,0,,Pardon me, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.83,0:01:53.52,Default,Cruz,0,0,0,,By the power invested in me by the spirits,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.52,0:01:56.85,Default,Cruz,0,0,0,,show me this individual's true \Npurpose and disposition.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.92,0:01:55.21,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(611,0)\an7\fs14\fnTimes New Roman\c&HFFFCF4&\3c&HCDAFA0&\bord0.75\blur1\b1\shad1\4c&H7D605F&\pos(14,20)}Name: Thirteenth Imperial Prince Noah Ararat \NSex: Male \NLevel: 1\h/\h∞ \NHP: F\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hFire: F\NMP: F\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hWater: SS\NStrength: F\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hWind: F\NStamina: F\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hEarth: F\NIntelligence: F\h\h\h\h\hLight: F
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.92,0:01:55.21,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(611,0)\an7\bord2\shad2\blur1\p1\fscy220\alpha&H50&\c&H2A1E1E&\3c&HF8D6AE&\4c&HB7775D&}m 0 0 l 266 0 266 53 0 53
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.63,0:02:00.77,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.30,0:02:03.76,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord3\fs40\fnTimes New Roman\b1\blur2\shad6\c&HFEFEFE&\3c&HDAB38F&\move(280.667,237.334,85,237.334)\4c&H74544D&\frx4\fry354}Water
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.69,0:02:03.76,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,The value changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.76,0:02:06.69,Default,Empress,0,0,0,,This can't be... It's so much \Nhigher than when he was born...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.69,0:02:09.30,Default,Cruz,0,0,0,,Does this mean he has already awakened?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.58,0:02:09.86,top,AideA,0,0,0,,Splendid!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.86,0:02:12.35,Default,Aides,0,0,0,,I've never heard of anyone \Nreaching SS at that age!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.83,0:02:14.31,top,Aides,0,0,0,,As expected of our emperor's child!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.35,0:02:15.41,Default,Aides,0,0,0,,We are witnessing the birth \Nof a man of immense talent!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.59,0:02:18.08,italicstop,Noah,0,0,0,,Whatever the case, I have \Nbeen granted a new life
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.21,0:02:21.50,italicstop,Noah,0,0,0,,and reincarnated as a noble.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:37.59,0:02:39.57,sign_generic,Title,0,0,0,,{\fade(109,0)\c&H4F7C81&\bord0\fnTimes New Roman\b1\fs10\pos(320,142.5)}Born Blessed, So I'll Obtain Ultimate Power
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.59,0:02:39.59,sign_generic,Title,0,0,0,,{\fade(109,0)\p1\bord2\c&H291505&\alpha&H255&\3c&H2986A5&\fscx87\pos(311,141.167)}m 0 0 l 235 0 l 225 8 l 235 15 l 18 15 l 30 8 l 18 0
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.12,0:03:58.00,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\bord0\b1\fade(488,722)\c&H00070B&\pos(320, 205)}Episode 1
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.12,0:03:58.00,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\bord0\b1\fade(488,722)\c&H00070B&\pos(320, 225)}Thirteenth Imperial Prince Noah Ararat
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.37,0:04:04.09,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Meeres Empire is a nation of warriors \Nnestled in a craggy mountain range.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.09,0:04:06.84,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,The capital is situated on an open plain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.94,0:04:12.22,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,As it enjoys its golden age in \Nwhich wealth begets wealth,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.22,0:04:15.22,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,a rich, resplendent culture \Nnow blooms in this nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.62,0:04:21.23,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Its emperor is the father to over ten \Nsons known as the Imperial Princes,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.63,0:04:26.86,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,who are revered and adored by the people \Nas the most renowned of nobles.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.70,0:04:32.75,Default,Jessie/Anna/Evelyn,0,0,0,,Good morning, Prince Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.21,0:04:38.22,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,Six years after my reincarnation, \NI've realized something.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.21,0:04:40.96,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs14\fnTimes New Roman\c&HFFFCF4&\3c&HCDAFA0&\bord0.75\blur1\b1\shad1\4c&H7D605F&\pos(14,20)}Name: Thirteenth Imperial Prince Noah Ararat \NSex: Male \NLevel: 1\h/\h∞ \NHP: F\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hFire: F\NMP: F\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hWater: SS\NStrength: F\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hWind: F\NStamina: F+F\h\h\h\h\hEarth: F\NIntelligence: F\h\h\h\hLight: F \NSpirit: F\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hDark: F \NSpeed: F \NDexterity: F+F
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.21,0:04:40.96,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord2\shad2\blur1\p1\fscy220\alpha&H50&\c&H43312A&\3c&HF8D6AE&\4c&HB7775D&}m 0 0 l 266 0 266 72 0 72
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.54,0:04:40.97,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,This is how my stats look to everyone else,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.96,0:04:43.47,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord3\fs40\fnTimes New Roman\b1\blur2\shad1\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HB68C6D&\frz346.2\pos(115.334,144.667)\frx16\fry18\4c&H58423F&}Water
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.96,0:04:43.47,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord3\fs40\fnTimes New Roman\b1\blur2\shad1\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HB68C6D&\frz346.2\frx16\fry18\4c&H58423F&\pos(108.667,334)}Wind
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.97,0:04:43.46,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,but to me, they look like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.83,0:04:46.68,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,These are additions made by my subordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.51,0:04:49.43,nameplate,Sign,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fade(275,471)\pos(600.667,263.333)}Noah Ararat\N{\fs13}Age 6\NThirteenth Prince
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.53,0:04:49.44,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,The S added to Water, for example,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.78,0:04:53.87,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,came from Almeria, the fief \NI was granted at birth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.42,0:04:56.35,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,The others came from my maids.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.35,0:04:59.86,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,In other words, I can grow stronger \Nby gaining more subordinates.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:59.86,0:05:04.95,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs14\fnTimes New Roman\c&HFFFCF4&\3c&HCDAFA0&\bord0.75\blur1\b1\shad1\4c&H7D605F&\pos(14,20)}Name: Thirteenth Imperial Prince Noah Ararat \NSex: Male \NLevel: 1\h/\h∞
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.86,0:05:04.95,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord2\shad2\blur1\p1\fscy220\alpha&H50&\c&H9D7261&\3c&HF8D6AE&\4c&HB7775D&}m 0 0 l 266 0 266 21 0 21
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.19,0:05:01.56,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,And my level...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.10,0:05:04.94,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,can be raised infinitely, I suppose?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.77,0:05:07.55,Default,MaidA,0,0,0,,Thank you for your patience.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.55,0:05:10.43,Default,MaidB,0,0,0,,You look very handsome again today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.43,0:05:11.11,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.11,0:05:13.12,Default,MaidA,0,0,0,,He is remarkable, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.12,0:05:16.91,Default,MaidB,0,0,0,,Most boys his age would be full of mischief, \Nbut he is so calm and composed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.91,0:05:20.22,Default,MaidA,0,0,0,,Perhaps that is what they \Ncall a "regal bearing."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.70,0:05:26.95,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,That said, my capabilities are \Nquite limited at age six.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.75,0:05:29.32,Default,Evelyn,0,0,0,,Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.92,0:05:33.09,italicstop,Noah,0,0,0,,Evelyn is a beautiful maid who \Nspecializes in hospitality.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.97,0:05:35.56,nameplate,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(275,471)\blur0.5\pos(518.667,266)\3c&H5E4F40&}Evelyn\N{\fs13}Beautiful\NSpecializes in Hospitality
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.47,0:05:38.17,top,Evelyn,0,0,0,,The Crown Prince and the Fourth \NPrince have come to visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.17,0:05:41.60,Default,Evelyn,0,0,0,,They say you can take your time \Neating before going to see them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.96,0:05:45.18,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,I most certainly cannot. \NHe's the Crown Prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.31,0:05:48.97,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Take me at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.90,0:05:53.96,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Good morning, dear brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.42,0:05:56.52,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,Ah, there you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.66,0:05:58.37,nameplate,Sign,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\an1\fade(275,471)\pos(38.667,258.667)}Albert Ararat\N{\fs13}Age 29\NCrown Prince, Second Prince
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.69,0:06:00.92,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I had just finished my meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.92,0:06:03.33,Default,Henry,0,0,0,,Sure, we'll leave it at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.33,0:06:06.93,Default,Henry,0,0,0,,I see Noah is as courteous as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.63,0:06:07.01,nameplate,Sign,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fade(275,471)\pos(601.333,264)}Henry Ararat\N{\fs14}Age 21 \NFourth Prince
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.29,0:06:10.91,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,Yes. He'll be a fine chancellor one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.91,0:06:12.92,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I will do my best to achieve that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.92,0:06:16.37,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,We have a present for you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.45,0:06:29.40,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.78,0:06:36.05,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,Open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.47,0:06:46.58,Default,KnightA,0,0,0,,N-No! It's going to eat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.46,0:06:47.64,top,KnightB,0,0,0,,Please! Please spare me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.83,0:06:49.10,Default,KnightC,0,0,0,,Please save us, Prince Albert!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.31,0:06:54.77,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.02,0:06:56.10,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.43,0:06:59.17,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,Nice sword, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.17,0:07:00.81,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Y-Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.81,0:07:02.10,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,Pick it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.29,0:07:08.95,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,It's a gift from the Crown Prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.95,0:07:10.53,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,I can't refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.98,0:07:12.48,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.47,0:07:22.87,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,Oh? I should have known.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.87,0:07:24.83,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,That sword is called Leviathan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.83,0:07:28.05,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,It is a water magic sword known \Nas the strongest in the empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.05,0:07:31.16,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,Around 120 people have \Ndied trying to master it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.83,0:07:35.18,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,That was close! I almost dropped \Nthe Crown Prince's gift!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.18,0:07:36.93,Default,Henry,0,0,0,,Worry not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.93,0:07:40.15,Default,Henry,0,0,0,,Those not meant to wield it are killed \Nby its curse the moment they lift it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.15,0:07:44.07,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,For most people, just carrying \Nthe box is agonizing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.07,0:07:48.19,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,I see. So one with water affinity \Nat level SS can wield it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.10,0:07:51.76,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,This has been a valuable demonstration.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.57,0:07:55.03,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,Sorry to interrupt your morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.59,0:07:58.54,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,That despicable Crown Prince was testing me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.86,0:08:02.16,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,No. If I say that out loud, I'm dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.93,0:08:04.25,Default,Henry,0,0,0,,Was that wise?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.71,0:08:06.79,Default,Henry,0,0,0,,That sword must be priceless.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.79,0:08:08.50,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,No matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.50,0:08:11.75,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,It's better off in the hands of \Nsomeone as brilliant as him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.75,0:08:12.95,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,Besides...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.39,0:08:15.60,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,it's precisely because he's so brilliant
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.60,0:08:19.53,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,that he needs to experience being \Nbitten by his own precious pet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.95,0:08:25.63,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Zoey, is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.94,0:08:27.33,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,You seem unhappy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.84,0:08:33.24,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,F-Forgive me. You needn't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.24,0:08:35.63,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,It's all right. Speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.33,0:08:38.49,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,Then, when you have time later—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.49,0:08:38.99,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Zoey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.59,0:08:47.87,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,The truth is... I'd like \Nto request some time off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.04,0:08:47.58,nameplate,Sign,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fade(275,471)\pos(599.334,264)\fs18}Zoey\N{\fs13}Age 18\NNoah's Personal Maid
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.34,0:08:50.02,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Has something happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.81,0:08:54.41,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,There was a flood in my hometown recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.41,0:08:56.21,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,The farm where I grew up was washed out,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.21,0:08:58.83,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,and my mother, who lives \Nalone, is now out of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.39,0:09:03.33,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,And... my relatives have told me to\Nwork in the red-light district.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.02,0:09:07.90,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,They say even I could sell myself \Nas someone who served a prince—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.90,0:09:09.37,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I've heard enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.45,0:09:15.31,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Very well. I will employ your \Nmother here at the mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.77,0:09:16.74,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.36,0:09:19.38,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I will put her in charge\Nof locking the rear gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.80,0:09:22.01,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I'll pay her ten rean per month.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.62,0:09:27.89,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,What? B-But, Master,\NI've never heard of such a job!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.89,0:09:30.75,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,And that is far higher \Nthan the standard wage...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.75,0:09:33.65,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,There's an unused house in the \Nwestern outskirts of the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.65,0:09:35.47,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,You and your mother can use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.29,0:09:44.15,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.15,0:09:46.03,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Continue your work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.03,0:09:47.05,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.05,0:09:52.02,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,A former servant of mine\Nworking in the red-light district?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.64,0:09:56.37,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,If I allow that, I'll sully the \Ntitle of Thirteenth Prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.37,0:10:01.33,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,She's my servant, \Nso she will serve me for life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.64,0:10:02.48,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Dylan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.01,0:10:04.23,Default,Dylan,0,0,0,,I am here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.90,0:10:08.10,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,There's been a flood in \NZoey's hometown, Dosso.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.10,0:10:09.48,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Are you aware of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.06,0:10:11.28,Default,Dylan,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.28,0:10:13.55,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Buy as much of the land there as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.55,0:10:14.66,Default,Dylan/Zoey,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.18,0:10:18.14,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,There will be villains trying to con \Npeople who've lost their livelihoods,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.14,0:10:20.70,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,like Zoey's family, out of their fortunes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.70,0:10:22.31,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Secure them before that happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.26,0:10:24.15,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.42,0:10:27.50,Default,Dylan,0,0,0,,Oh, I am merely surprised to see you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.50,0:10:32.40,Default,Dylan,0,0,0,,handling a situation you've never \Nexperienced before with such foresight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.40,0:10:35.07,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,I saw more than my share of \Nit before I reincarnated.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.07,0:10:36.11,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,But I can't tell him that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.11,0:10:39.09,Default,Dylan,0,0,0,,But how shall I procure the funds?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.09,0:10:43.09,Default,Dylan,0,0,0,,By my estimate, that would require \Napproximately 700,000 rean.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.09,0:10:44.09,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,Seven hun—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.66,0:10:46.33,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.70,0:10:48.68,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,I can't blame her for being surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.14,0:10:53.01,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,The average annual income of an adult \Nman in the capital is 120 rean.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.01,0:10:56.35,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,Even my own retainers earn \Neight thousand rean per year.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.71,0:11:02.22,bronze_sign,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(546,97.333)}Emperor
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.71,0:11:02.22,bronze_sign,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(477.334,226.667)}Thirteenth Prince
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.71,0:11:02.22,bronze_sign,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(346.667,337.333)}Almeria
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.90,0:10:59.21,italicstop,Noah,0,0,0,,Add in the tax revenue from Almeria
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.21,0:11:01.87,italicstop,Noah,0,0,0,,and monetary gifts from the emperor,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.78,0:11:06.77,italicstop,Noah,0,0,0,,and the Thirteenth Prince's household \Nhas about 500,000 rean to work with.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.01,0:11:06.93,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(154,223)\b1\c&H1B4E72&\bord0\fnTimes New Roman\pos(460.667,218)}500,000R
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.36,0:11:09.31,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,That leaves 200,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.91,0:11:13.29,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,We own land south of the capital, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.68,0:11:15.28,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,We'll have to sell it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.28,0:11:18.84,Default,Dylan,0,0,0,,Wha—But that land was \Na gift from His Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.84,0:11:21.73,Default,Dylan,0,0,0,,To sell it without his permission would \Nbe a crime against the imperial family!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.73,0:11:24.94,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,That's fine. I will accept \Nmy father's reproach.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.94,0:11:25.87,Default,Dylan,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.87,0:11:26.65,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,Prince Noah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.94,0:11:29.15,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Nobles have their obligations.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.15,0:11:30.93,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Sometimes, they must sacrifice themselves
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.93,0:11:33.72,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,to bring happiness to as many \Nof their people as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.71,0:11:39.33,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Playing the martyr is one of the \Nprivileges of the nobility.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.33,0:11:42.17,Default,Dylan,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Highness. As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.12,0:11:46.06,Default,Dylan,0,0,0,,Also, Prince Noah...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.48,0:11:47.60,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.64,0:11:51.68,nameplate,Sign,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fade(274,307)\an1\fs18\pos(186.666,276.667)}Dylan\N{\fs13}The Thirteenth Prince's Butler
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.97,0:11:50.97,Default,Dylan,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.97,0:11:52.01,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.37,0:11:55.97,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,I forgot Dylan also came \Nfrom that same area.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.41,0:11:58.70,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,This goes inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.70,0:12:02.36,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,Oh, wait. Yes, put that one in \Nthe second carriage, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.36,0:12:05.80,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,And all of those can go \Nin the first carriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.05,0:12:06.93,top,Henry,0,0,0,,Awfully busy out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.95,0:12:11.22,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! I failed to come and greet you,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.90,0:12:13.64,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Brother Henry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.64,0:12:15.08,Default,Henry,0,0,0,,Think nothing of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.08,0:12:17.93,Default,Henry,0,0,0,,Anyway, are you going somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.22,0:12:22.86,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Yes. I'm purchasing land in an area \Ncalled Dosso, which has flooded.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.86,0:12:24.39,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I'm going to inspect it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.39,0:12:26.80,Default,Henry,0,0,0,,Oh? Well that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.26,0:12:28.47,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.14,0:12:32.23,Default,Henry,0,0,0,,Do you intend to use the magic sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.23,0:12:37.32,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,No, I did sense some sort of power in \Nit, but I haven't felt it since then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.32,0:12:39.58,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I'm just taking it with me as a test.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.58,0:12:40.73,Default,Henry,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.20,0:12:43.44,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Is that why you came to talk to me alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.46,0:12:49.12,Default,Henry,0,0,0,,Since Albert said such strange \Nthings, I looked into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.46,0:12:52.26,Default,Henry,0,0,0,,It seems that sword has a will of its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.82,0:12:54.02,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,A will?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.02,0:12:58.74,Default,Henry,0,0,0,,Apparently, it only obeys the one \Nit recognizes as its master.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.95,0:13:01.84,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I must earn its recognition.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.10,0:13:04.76,flashback,KnightB,0,0,0,,{\fade(0,1019)\t(1641,2660,\c&H000000&)\t(1641,2660,\3c&H000000&)}Please! Please spare me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.69,0:13:07.71,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,It's like a mad dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.20,0:13:12.02,Default,Henry,0,0,0,,Carry it with you if you \Nmust, but don't use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.71,0:13:13.81,Default,Henry,0,0,0,,You will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.42,0:13:22.70,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,How awful...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.70,0:13:24.83,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Dylan, go to the government office.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.28,0:13:27.28,Default,Dylan,0,0,0,,By which you mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.74,0:13:32.05,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,From the looks of it, I'd say most of the \Nruined homes lost their land deeds, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.52,0:13:35.53,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,We'll have to purchase them based \Non the government office's lists.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.00,0:13:37.86,Default,Dylan,0,0,0,,I-I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.26,0:13:41.12,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,I'm amazed you ascertained \Nthat from just one look.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.12,0:13:44.12,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,If anything happens, I'll \Nassume responsibility. Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.12,0:13:46.10,Default,Dylan,0,0,0,,It will be done, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.23,0:13:49.92,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Zoey, come with me. I need \Nto know the lay of the land.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.92,0:13:50.98,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,O-Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.88,0:13:54.34,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,So the root vegetables have \Nalready started to rot?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.15,0:13:57.18,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,There'll be no harvest this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.65,0:14:00.50,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,I still think this is dangerous, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.50,0:14:02.25,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,You didn't need to come this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.25,0:14:06.03,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,If you insist on stopping me, \NI'll sneak out alone overnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.03,0:14:08.50,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,But... I can't let you...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.25,0:14:15.64,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,They're distributing food.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.64,0:14:18.01,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Looks like the empire is doing its job.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.13,0:14:21.70,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,It's so bland. It's barely \Nmore than boiled water.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.59,0:14:26.30,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.85,0:14:30.15,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,This tastes horrible!\NIs it already spoiled?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.15,0:14:31.13,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,This can't be—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.13,0:14:33.25,Default,Old ManA,0,0,0,,We can't ask for too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.22,0:14:38.16,Default,Old ManA,0,0,0,,We're just lucky we get\Nto eat, even if it's this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.16,0:14:39.93,Default,Old ManA,0,0,0,,We must accept it gratefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.15,0:14:43.58,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,But I can't believe the empire \Nwould distribute food like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.58,0:14:45.72,Default,Old ManA,0,0,0,,Oh, boy. Here he comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.99,0:14:49.59,Default,Captain,0,0,0,,Inspection!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.98,0:14:50.73,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.62,0:14:54.72,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,The local government official, Lord Garil.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.78,0:15:01.40,Default,DistributorB,0,0,0,,Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.50,0:15:05.41,Default,Garil,0,0,0,,Hmm... Looks all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.68,0:15:08.71,Default,DistributorA,0,0,0,,Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.71,0:15:11.38,Default,DistributorA,0,0,0,,Your portion is ready in the mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.38,0:15:14.74,Default,Garil,0,0,0,,Thorough as always, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.74,0:15:15.95,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Getting kickbacks for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.64,0:15:20.18,top,Old ManA,0,0,0,,H-Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.64,0:15:20.18,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.76,0:15:22.14,Default,Garil,0,0,0,,Who are you, boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.14,0:15:23.99,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Did you hire them for kickbacks?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.99,0:15:24.87,Default,Garil,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.53,0:15:27.31,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,You did, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.43,0:15:30.73,Default,Garil,0,0,0,,Big talk for such a little boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.73,0:15:33.57,Default,Garil,0,0,0,,This is tough work for us, too, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.57,0:15:36.04,Default,Garil,0,0,0,,Taking a little something in return
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.04,0:15:39.20,Default,Garil,0,0,0,,is a privilege afforded to \Nthose of us who give so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.20,0:15:40.95,Default,DistributorA,0,0,0,,Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.95,0:15:43.29,Default,DistributorA,0,0,0,,You just learned a valuable lesson, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.41,0:15:50.63,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,To call me a child is condescending.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.84,0:15:56.99,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Getting rich off of rations intended \Nfor disaster victims is a crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.99,0:16:00.07,Default,Garil,0,0,0,,What was that, you rotten little brat?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.60,0:16:07.04,Default,Garil,0,0,0,,To insult me is to insult\NSir Rowen, the ruler of this land!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.04,0:16:08.21,Default,Garil,0,0,0,,Do you realize—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.60,0:16:11.35,top,Noah,0,0,0,,Tyrannizing the weak to curry \Nfavor with the strong...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.75,0:16:15.93,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Would you like to hear your sentence?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.93,0:16:18.40,Default,Garil,0,0,0,,Enough of your nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.74,0:16:19.69,italicstop,Noah,0,0,0,,Reminds me of that sword...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.69,0:16:22.17,Default,Garil,0,0,0,,You rotten little brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.83,0:16:22.17,top,Noah,0,0,0,,It's death!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.08,0:16:29.04,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.59,0:16:36.08,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I bet you're angry that I associated \Nyou with the likes of this trash, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.68,0:16:40.11,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,If so, then show me your strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.39,0:16:58.62,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,So you are the strong one...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.37,0:17:02.17,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,and I am the weak one, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.24,0:17:07.03,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,That's very small of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.23,0:17:13.41,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,The strong only flaunt their \Npower before the weak
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.89,0:17:16.29,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,because they fear someone even stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.49,0:17:21.76,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,If you were born strong...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.95,0:17:25.49,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,If you succeeded in being born strong...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.38,0:17:37.25,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,then use that power for \Nthe good of the people!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.65,0:17:41.65,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,That is my privilege as a noble!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.13,0:17:45.14,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Obey me, Leviathan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.88,0:17:49.91,Default,Garil,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.09,0:17:58.36,Default,DistributorA,0,0,0,,Lord Garil!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.36,0:17:59.45,Default,DistributorB,0,0,0,,You brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.45,0:18:00.34,Default,Captain,0,0,0,,Lord Garil!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.34,0:18:02.18,Default,Captain,0,0,0,,Apprehend that child!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.92,0:18:06.84,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.00,0:18:16.44,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,I-Incredible...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.04,0:18:21.87,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I can't even see the bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.14,0:18:24.98,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,You are insane, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.32,0:18:27.34,Default,Rowen,0,0,0,,Wh-What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.34,0:18:28.30,Default,KnightB,0,0,0,,Let us through!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.20,0:18:30.29,Default,Rowen,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.52,0:18:34.43,Default,DistributorA,0,0,0,,Please save us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.43,0:18:38.18,Default,DistributorA,0,0,0,,Lord Garil... Lord Garil was \Nmurdered by that child!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.18,0:18:38.89,Default,Rowen,0,0,0,,A child?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.68,0:18:44.68,nameplate,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(274,307)\b1\blur0.5\an1\fs18\pos(41.333,253)\3c&H423D3D&}Rowen\N{\fs13}Knight Captain Who Rules Dosso
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.57,0:18:52.25,Default,Rowen,0,0,0,,I-I apologize for being unaware that \Nyou were visiting, Thirteenth Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.25,0:18:53.99,Default,DistributorA,0,0,0,,Sir Rowen?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.99,0:18:55.78,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,You know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.78,0:18:58.36,Default,Rowen,0,0,0,,Yes. I am Rowen Green.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.36,0:19:01.89,Default,Rowen,0,0,0,,I was only recently appointed to maintain \Nsecurity in this region.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.89,0:19:04.05,Default,Rowen,0,0,0,,I am a servant of Prince Henry's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.52,0:19:06.21,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Oh, my brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.12,0:19:08.28,Default,People,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.28,0:19:09.60,top,People,0,0,0,,Sir Rowen is...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.70,0:19:10.76,Default,Rowen,0,0,0,,What are you people doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.60,0:19:10.94,top,People,0,0,0,,Who is that child?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.76,0:19:13.09,Default,Rowen,0,0,0,,You are in the presence of\NHis Highness the Thirteenth Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.94,0:19:12.15,top,Old Man,0,0,0,,What's the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.62,0:19:25.71,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Rowen, I'll be borrowing you for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.71,0:19:27.69,Default,Rowen,0,0,0,,Of course. I am at your service.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.45,0:19:30.86,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Someone hired these food \Ndistributors for kickbacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.81,0:19:34.23,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I punished this man, who was behind it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.23,0:19:36.48,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Those men are his accomplices.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.48,0:19:38.30,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Deal the punishment they deserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.31,0:19:42.35,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,We'll start over with the food distribution.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.63,0:19:43.94,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Add more to that soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.94,0:19:47.85,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,So much that I can stand a \Nspoon in it and it won't fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.85,0:19:48.88,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Can you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.88,0:19:51.66,Default,Rowen,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Highness!\NIf it costs me my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.13,0:19:56.71,Default,Old ManA,0,0,0,,We'll get to eat... proper food?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.71,0:19:58.82,Default,Slick Guy,0,0,0,,Long live the Thirteenth Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.82,0:20:06.11,Default,People,0,0,0,,Banzai! Banzai! Banzai! Banzai!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.11,0:20:10.00,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,Prince Noah, you are incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.27,0:20:16.94,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,Understood. Now go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.97,0:20:23.63,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,Not only did he not get bitten, but that \Nmad dog actually submitted to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.74,0:20:27.87,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,He may be even more useful than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.75,0:20:30.31,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I am Noah Ararat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.31,0:20:33.55,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I have come in answer to \NHis Majesty's summons.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.55,0:20:35.23,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,I heard the reports.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.23,0:20:39.82,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,You sold the land I granted you \Nand bought an entire village?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.50,0:20:42.63,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,Here it comes...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.34,0:20:46.19,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,I thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.40,0:20:53.96,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Your efforts have prevented the emergence of \Nanyone trying to take advantage of the flood.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.96,0:20:56.97,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Were this natural disaster \Nfollowed by a man-made disaster,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.97,0:21:02.35,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,we would have had to commit imperial \Nresources to cleaning up the mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.19,0:21:02.19,nameplate,Sign,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\b1\fs14\fade(275,472)\pos(498,264.667)}Emperor of Meeres Empire
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.31,0:21:05.53,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,How did you learn of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.53,0:21:07.06,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,It was coincidental.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.06,0:21:11.36,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,One of my maids happens \Nto be from that village.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.81,0:21:15.05,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,I see. Still, providence also played a part.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.51,0:21:19.09,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,You mastered a water magic sword \Nin that village, did you not?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.09,0:21:20.66,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,You knew about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.09,0:21:26.04,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,It has been some time. I would like \Nto see Noah's abilities again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.30,0:21:29.03,Default,Cruz,0,0,0,,Pardon me, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.65,0:21:37.01,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,I guess it's not just human subordinates \Nthat can add to my stats.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:35.27,0:21:38.10,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(985,0)\an7\fs14\fnTimes New Roman\c&HFFFCF4&\3c&HCDAFA0&\bord0.75\blur1\b1\shad1\4c&H7D605F&\pos(14,20)}HP: F\h\h\h\h\hFire: F\NMP: F\h\h\h\h\hWater: E+SS\NStrength: F+F\h\h\h\h\hWind: F\NStamina: F+F\h\h\h\h\hEarth: F
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.27,0:21:38.10,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(985,0)\an7\bord2\shad2\blur1\p1\fscy220\alpha&H50&\c&H967271&\3c&HF8D6AE&\4c&HB7775D&}m 0 0 l 145 0 145 28 0 28
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.36,0:21:41.09,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,This isn't what I usually see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.09,0:21:43.11,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Splendid!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.11,0:21:44.32,Default,Cruz,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 1,0:21:44.11,0:21:48.53,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(985,0)\an7\fs14\fnTimes New Roman\c&HFFFCF4&\3c&HCDAFA0&\bord0.75\blur1\b1\shad1\4c&H7D605F&\pos(14,20)}Name: Thirteenth Imperial Prince Noah Ararat \NSex: Male \NLevel: 1\h/\h∞\NHP: F\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hFire: F\NMP: F\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hWater: SSS \NWind: F\h\h\h\h\hEarth: F \NLight: F\h\h\h\h\hDark: F
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.11,0:21:48.53,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(985,0)\an7\bord2\shad2\blur1\p1\fscy220\alpha&H50&\c&H695751&\3c&HF8D6AE&\4c&HB7775D&}m 0 0 l 265 0 265 48 0 48
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.73,0:21:48.53,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,Water is now SSS, with no plus sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.10,0:21:51.39,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.35,0:21:56.14,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I ask that you continue to \Naid me with your talents.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.21,0:21:58.27,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Of course!
